msgid "Space Pairings"
msgstr "Emparejamientos de Space"

#: includes/integrations/class-fluent-community.php:1146
msgid ""
"Each row pairs one FluentCommunity space with one Jetonomy space. A tab "
"linking between the two appears on both sides. Leave the Jetonomy column set "
"to \"Not paired\" to disable a row."
msgstr ""
"Cada fila empareja un Space de FluentCommunity con un Space de Jetonomy. Una "
"pestaña que vincula entre los dos aparece en ambos lados. Deja la columna de "
"Jetonomy configurada en \"No emparejado\" para desactivar una fila."

